{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>資深電影人谷薇麗日前不幸離世，演藝界深表惋惜，終年73歲。今日（5月14日）於香港殯儀館設靈，其家人神情哀傷，一早到場打點，讓生前親友作最後告別。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260510/1130259592010272768439287.jpeg/39MfI4xqLO2XyTF9AriWCnmT3uZZG13uDRUPBA0VDwQ\" alt=\"谷薇麗。(網上圖片)\"><figcaption>谷薇麗。(網上圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>靈堂佈置簡潔莊嚴</p><p>靈堂現場布置以白色調為主，風格簡潔優雅，貫徹谷薇麗生前低調而不失氣派的作風。靈堂中央牌匾寫着《永遠懷念你》，遺照中她笑容溫暖，神態祥和。靈堂兩側及門外早已擺滿來自演藝圈好友及各界合作夥伴的花牌，整齊延伸至走廊，形成一片白色的花海。</p><p>谷薇麗生前人緣極佳，獲不少圈中人送上花牌悼念，包括有周潤發、鄭伊健、張達明、利雅博、麥當雄、盧冠廷，唐書琛、導演張婉婷、李居明、田啟文、林珊珊、陳淑芬等等，足以見證她在行內的廣闊人緣及德高望重的地位。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131616999362138112635290.jpeg/HXEcSd7RAj4lSP4MMnONzf7YF-fCo70Fb820EFnNtBA\" alt=\"周潤發夫婦。（葉志明 攝）\"><figcaption>周潤發夫婦。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131616996644098048972654.jpeg/EFjtqZrSfhm-D6OasHgzmNRzrOvGGYpWH6N0SimjdEo\" alt=\"鄭伊健。（葉志明 攝）\"><figcaption>鄭伊健。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131616993942835200596174.jpeg/emCmeC40OfzibCPFXUYTLektzU99JppX3BvvUuob71I\" alt=\"林珊珊。（葉志明 攝）\"><figcaption>林珊珊。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131616991006691328705643.jpeg/n8dwEg2boY_8vfqTy01KM8Dt_WQwwogUU-VnMWXlZzE\" alt=\"陳淑芬。（葉志明 攝）\"><figcaption>陳淑芬。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131616999882231808796824.jpeg/irExoOHM2SYblQMwoaCqm9zgx2IBZbFHGkivoixIr6I\" alt=\"Yumiko。（葉志明 攝）\"><figcaption>Yumiko。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131616997063528448078291.jpeg/wWVsgvpVLfcTqnKUz8rAH5VQvoBfokSOF61hTSGtYU0\" alt=\"丁家衛夫婦。（葉志明 攝）\"><figcaption>丁家衛夫婦。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131616991208017920170563.jpeg/20sjEyDeDsbfCuj7ARS7zdkJL1nM77rJaU_bCV9P2wk\" alt=\"谷薇麗設靈。（葉志明 攝）\"><figcaption>谷薇麗設靈。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131618432932909056178042.jpeg/WEahnuiJXdT6TuUR68xsPmp4IiRQT_Z9u5tl2o2bZdo\" alt=\"白色花海送別。（葉志明 攝）\"><figcaption>白色花海送別。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T08:15:52.016927+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":418,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}